From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:26:19 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 264/297] Meridian: agents press key chords, right- and
 double-click, hover, and Enter works in background tabs

Key chords go to the page, never the browser's shortcuts. Enter and typing
now reach a chat composer in a tab in the background. Right click fires the
page's own menu, double click and hover reach its handlers. The groundwork
for handing an approved file to a chooser a site button opens is in place
but not yet used by upload_file.

